179	     * The owner's salutation, derived at response time from the optional {@link #title} and the
180	     * {@link #getLastName() lastName}: the title, a single space, then the lastName (e.g.
181	     * {@code DR Who}) when a title is present, otherwise just the lastName. Not persisted as a
