227	    /**
228	     * The owner's unified member id, formatted {@code <REGIONV2><FY><HASH8><CHK>} — the version-2
229	     * {@link #regionCodeV2(String) region code} (the plain region with the {@link #IDENTITY_VERSION}
230	     * tag mixed in), the two-digit fiscal year, the 8 upper-case hex HASH8 of the region-and-hash
231	     * identity, and a single Luhn check digit over the digits of {@code <REGIONV2><FY><HASH8>}.
232	     * Assigned at creation (see {@code AssignOwnerMemberId}); it is the owner's single primary
233	     * identifier, replacing the former {@code customerCode}, {@code membershipNumber} and standalone
234	     * {@code checkDigit}. The user-facing {@link #getLocality() locality}, {@link #getFiscalYear()
235	     * fiscal year} and {@link #getOwnerSegment() owner segment} are derived independently from the
236	     * postcode and registration date, so the version-2 tag stays inside this identifier.
237	     */
238	    public String getMemberId() {
